1. Dev (not guaranteed to be stable. Used for testing modifications to deployment, or upgrades to DataHub)
2. Pre-production ('preprod', generally stable, can be used to preview new features to a wider audience)
3. Production ('prod'). The most stable; user-facing. Only contains builds which have been previewed and tested in preprod.

Each environment instance of Find MoJ Data has a corresponding instance of DataHub.

